=== (c) timing. 1e7 and 5e7 calls, 15 interleaved reps each, microseconds, timer:tc resolution = 1 us (monotonic clock)
emu_flavor=jit  arch=x86_64-conda-linux-gnu
N=10000000 calls  empty-loop median 24652 us | PascalCase export median 111790 us (min 105838 max 122849) | alias export median 112651 us (min 105805 max 141951)
        per call above loop: Pascal 8.71 ns, alias 8.80 ns, alias-minus-Pascal 0.09 ns
        NEGATIVE CONTROL (the probe must see a real extra cost): the same call plus one erlang:phash2/1 BIF per iteration, median 205516 us = 18.09 ns/call above loop
N=50000000 calls  empty-loop median 125782 us | PascalCase export median 563003 us (min 543512 max 702661) | alias export median 582620 us (min 538380 max 771341)
